title: A right click on an icon of a bar hides it, and a right click on the free part of a bar lists every icon, ticked when shown, to bring it back to its place
folders: rust-small
limit: 60
expect-log: the icon deps is hidden from the bars
expect-log: the icon deps is back on the bars
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3000
ui right 1680 98
wait 800
mark a-icon-menu
wait 500
ui click 1556 150
wait 1000
mark b-icon-hidden
wait 500
ui right 1680 500
wait 800
mark c-list-of-icons
wait 500
ui click 1500 693
wait 1000
mark d-icon-back
wait 500
quit
